  "test": "real-mixed-cluster-frozen-oci-inputs-and-guarded-argocd-upgrade",
  "note": "Runs before the final release tag against immutable public GHCR candidate digests. The existing cluster-wide Argo installation upgrades from published 0.5.2 to 0.6.0. Fresh consuming Images test unknown placement, explicit AMD64/ARM64, cache controls, source refusal, a missing native base platform, and later ARM64 demand after deleting and recreating only the disposable fixture base Image. All material roots are complete two-platform indexes and retain the original dependency identities. Consumer Deployments and Pods are removed; registry data and release contracts remain. The permanent installation is not uninstalled, downgraded, interrupted or moved between Nodes. CLI/Helm removals and interruptions are covered in the separate native matrix. No Node labels or eligibility are changed. Publication is verified separately. Internal Node names, kubeconfig context, private repository references and credential material are omitted.",
